A [[favored class]] is a [[race]]'s preferred class. When [[Class#Multiclassing|multiclassing]], it helps avoid a [[multiclass penalty]].

The favored classes for each race are as follows:

*[[Human]]: Any. The character's highest-level class does not count when determining multiclass penalties.
*[[Half-Elf]]: Any. The character's highest-level class does not count when determining multiclass penalties.
*[[Elf]]: [[Wizard]]
*[[Dwarf]]: [[Fighter]]
*[[Halfling]]: [[Rogue]]
*[[Gnome]]: [[Wizard]]
*[[Half-Orc]]: [[Barbarian]]
